let\f0\'b4s say that our business plan has a goal of achieving 2500 active users. can you put some cash projections together assuming that we achieve this\par
\par
Yes. We can build a rough financial model based on 2,500 active monthly users (MAU) and a mixture of gaming, surveys, marketplace activity, and freelance jobs.\par
\par
The biggest variable is how active those users are, so I'll create a conservative, expected, and optimistic scenario.\par
