The key takeaway is that with only 2,500 active users, the survey/task network is likely to generate the majority of revenue initially, while the CAD marketplace, NFT marketplace, and CADBOXX jobs board become the higher-margin long-term businesses because they are based on transaction fees rather than paying users directly from advertising or survey revenue.\par
